<title>JAPAN: Keihin Express Rail - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Keihin Express Rail - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 72.67		vs	   65.11</p>
<p> Operating	   10.87		vs	    9.22</p>
<p> Current		4.43		vs	    2.88</p>
<p> Net		    2.22		vs	    1.58</p>
<p> EPS		    4.36 yen	  vs	    3.17 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    512 million	  vs	 497 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Keihin Electric Express Railway Co Ltd operates a line between Tokyo, Yokohama and the Miura Peninsula.</p>
</text>
